{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"仿射态射"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"代数几何","text":"代数几何"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"仿射态射"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>仿射态射是"},{"Local":{"url":"相对","text":"相对"}},{"Plain":"版本的"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"的态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$, 若对任意仿射开集 $U\\subset Y$, 其原像 $X\\times_Y U$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":", 则称 $f$ 为<strong>仿射态射</strong>.</p>\n<h3>仿射函子</h3>\n<p>与仿射性相关的性质可在"},{"Local":{"url":"拟凝聚层","text":"拟凝聚层"}},{"Plain":"范畴的层面读出, 这是"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶仿射性","text":"高阶仿射性"}},{"Plain":"的基础案例.\n设 $F\\colon \\mathcal C_0 \\to \\mathcal C$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"可表现范畴","text":"可表现"}},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":"之间的函子, 假设其右伴随 $F^R\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C_0$ 保持余极限. (想象 $F = f^*\\colon \\mathsf{QCoh}(Y)\\to\\mathsf{QCoh}(X)$, $F^R = f_*$.) 由于 $F^R$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"松幺半函子","text":"松幺半函子"}},{"Plain":", $F^R(1_{\\mathcal C})$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":", 且 $F^R$ 可提升为函子 $\\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{LMod}_{\\mathcal C_0}(F^R(1_{\\mathcal C}))$. 若该函子为同构, 则称 $F$ 为<strong>仿射函子</strong>.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>仿射态射是"},{"Local":{"url":"局部性质","text":"目标上的局部性质"}},{"Plain":", 在"},{"Local":{"url":"基变换","text":"基变换"}},{"Plain":"下稳定.</p>\n<p><strong>定理</strong>. 对于仿射态射 $p\\colon Y\\to X$, 有 $p_*\\mathcal O_Y$为"},{"Local":{"url":"拟凝聚层","text":"拟凝聚"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal O_X$-代数, 且 $Y$ 到"},{"Local":{"url":"相对谱","text":"相对谱"}},{"Plain":"的典范的映射 $Y\\to\\operatorname{Spec}_X(p_*\\mathcal O_Y)$ 为同构.</p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"闭嵌入","text":"闭嵌入"}},{"Plain":"都是仿射态射.</p>\n"}]}}